# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SECRETS AND PERSONAL TRADING DATA
#
# Read this section before adding anything to it.
#
# This repository is intended to be public. Two categories of file must never
# reach it:
#
#   1. Credentials — API keys, broker tokens, the webhook HMAC secret.
#   2. Your trading data — the Shani database holds your P&L, your positions,
#      and your playbook. That playbook IS your edge, written down. Publishing
#      it is worse than publishing a password, because you cannot rotate it.
#
# Default data locations live outside the repo (see shani/config.py, which uses
# platformdirs), so the entries below are a second line of defence for anyone
# who overrides the paths to somewhere local.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.key
*.pem
secrets.yaml
config.local.yaml

# Databases and journal data
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
data/
journal/
playbook/

# Chart screenshots captured at trade entry — these show your positions.
screenshots/
*.entry.png

# Exported trade history
exports/
*.trades.csv

# ─── Python ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
.venv/
venv/
ENV/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
coverage.xml

# ─── Node / portal ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
.next/
out/
.turbo/
*.tsbuildinfo
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# ─── Editors and OS ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ─── Tooling ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.impeccable/cache/
.claude/settings.local.json
